Question: What is the Toughness of an Intercessor Squad?
SELECT d.name, m.name AS model, m.t FROM datasheets d JOIN datasheets_models m ON m.DatasheetId = d.Id WHERE d.name LIKE '%Intercessor Squad%' LIMIT 50

Question: Which Space Marines units have the Grenades keyword?
SELECT DISTINCT d.name FROM datasheets d JOIN factions f ON f.Id = d.factionId JOIN datasheets_keywords k ON k.DatasheetId = d.Id WHERE f.name = 'Space Marines' AND k.keyword = 'Grenades' LIMIT 50
